### 12.2 Tool-use rules

- Use read-only tools before write tools.
- Use the expert database only for support-routing purposes.
- Do not search the entire employee directory without a support topic.
- Do not call `send_handoff` until the summary is complete and allowed.
- Do not send restricted content to experts unless the workflow allows it.
- Do not expose raw tool outputs to users.

